@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title ACTIVITY - UC07/08 UPLOAD & PARSE CV - FINGERPRINTED IDEMPOTENCY + EXCLUSIVE CAS

start
:Candidate/HR chọn PDF/DOCX;
:Client tạo Idempotency-Key UUID cho logical upload;
:POST /api/v1/resumes/upload + Idempotency-Key;
:Backend đọc bytes, kiểm <=5MB + MIME/magic bytes;
if (file invalid?) then (Có)
  :413/415;
  stop
endif
:request_fingerprint = SHA-256(raw file bytes);
:Derive resume_id UUIDv5 bằng namespace cố định
bd7b1f30-b2de-549c-a8dd-8d742ee5bc12
+ actor + canonical route + key;
:Lookup deterministic Resume id;
if (Resume đã tồn tại?) then (Có)
  if (stored fingerprint = request fingerprint?) then (Không)
    :409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED;
    stop
  endif
  :Không ghi đè file/storage;
  if (existing vẫn PENDING và chưa xóa?) then (Có)
    :Best-effort re-dispatch current_revision;
  endif
  :202 cùng Resume hiện hữu;
  stop
endif

:storage_key = resumes/{resume_id}/source;
:put-if-absent/no-overwrite;
if (storage object đã tồn tại?) then (Có)
  :Compute SHA-256 bytes object hiện hữu;
  if (object fingerprint != request fingerprint?) then (Có)
    :409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED;
    :Không overwrite object;
    stop
  endif
  :Reuse verified orphan/current object;
endif

:INSERT Resume PENDING revision=1
+ create_request_fingerprint;
if (deterministic PK race?) then (Có)
  :Re-read Resume;
  if (persisted fingerprint != request fingerprint?) then (Có)
    :409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED;
    stop
  endif
  :Return existing resource semantics;
else (Không)
  :COMMIT persistence;
endif
:Best-effort enqueue parse(resume_id,current_revision);
if (dispatcher lỗi?) then (Có)
  :Log dispatch failure;
  :Giữ Resume PENDING;
  :Recovery sweeper sẽ re-dispatch current_revision;
endif
:202 ResumeUploadResponse;

:Worker nhận resume_id, expected_revision;
:Exclusive CAS claim PROCESSING
WHERE revision=expected_revision
AND parsing_status=PENDING
AND is_deleted=FALSE;
if (claim rowcount=0?) then (Có)
  :Stale/duplicate/deleted task -> discard;
  stop
endif
:Extract text;
if (không có text?) then (Có)
  if (OCR Advanced bật?) then (Có)
    :OCR fallback;
  else (Không)
    :CAS FAILED + error
WHERE revision=expected_revision
AND parsing_status=PROCESSING
AND is_deleted=FALSE;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Parse entities/sections/skills;
:Map Skill Taxonomy seed;
:Generate embedding + model + preprocessing version;
:BEGIN terminal transaction;
:Lock/check Resume vẫn PROCESSING,
revision=expected_revision,
is_deleted=FALSE;
if (check fail?) then (Có)
  :ROLLBACK + stale/duplicate/deleted discard;
  stop
endif
:Persist candidate_profile/skills/exp/edu + embedding;
:CAS PARSED
WHERE revision=expected_revision
AND parsing_status=PROCESSING
AND is_deleted=FALSE;
:COMMIT;
:Worker không tăng revision khi commit;
stop

legend bottom
Fingerprint Resume = SHA-256 raw file bytes.
Same key + different fingerprint => 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED.
Nếu storage write thành công nhưng DB insert fail, orphan object được giữ;
retry chỉ reuse sau khi hash object khớp fingerprint, không overwrite.
Recovery sweeper chỉ scan PENDING + is_deleted=FALSE quá grace window và re-dispatch current revision.
Không reset PROCESSING timeout trong MVP nếu chưa có lease/attempt token.
Concurrent soft-delete làm terminal CAS fail/rollback.
endlegend
@enduml
